      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": -503.99999999999994,
        "y": -100
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Send / receive\n\nThe drawing fans into the Renderer (preview) AND a generic Send node on channel \"eink\" — it rasterises the layers to a PNG onto the in-app bus. Anything that pulls that channel paints it: a Raspberry Pi, or another Floret tab with a Receive node.\n\nsend toggle = push now · interval = auto-push (seconds). width/height set the sent resolution.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Send / receive\n\nThe drawing fans into the Renderer (preview) AND a generic Send node on channel \"eink\" — it rasterises the layers to a PNG onto the in-app bus. Anything that pulls that channel paints it: a Raspberry Pi, or another Floret tab with a Receive node.\n\nsend toggle = push now · interval = auto-push (seconds). width/height set the sent resolution.",
